    {
      "id": "claim_c8b7bafb59234423bb3aaca0a4281a9c",
      "statement": "LLM scope excludes three disjoint groups — criteria marked N/A by the inventory, criteria flagged external_dep in the registry, and D-tagged criteria that already have a deterministic score — and because the third is a conjunction, a D-tagged criterion lacking a deterministic scorer still reaches the LLM.",
