    {
      "id": "claim_bcb3ccfa4fd84517ab6f33692ebb87bd",
      "statement": "Each section produces exactly one batched LLM call covering every in-scope criterion, with the French prompt listing criteria as id-and-label lines, appending a deterministic-signal annotation where h_signals supplies one, and instructing the model to set not_evaluated rather than guess.",
