    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1de5088e1266496dac674afe11606502",
      "statement": "Only dict-valued response entries for in-scope criteria are collected from a batched response, so a malformed or hallucinated key in the model's JSON is silently dropped rather than corrupting the run.",
