    {
      "id": "claim_1731153d509b4f13bea71a452379ff3c",
      "statement": "The judgment cost model is one batched call per section, so LLM calls per document equal the number of sections — pinned by a test where a 20,000-character document at 8,000-character sections makes exactly three calls — making section sizing a directly legible cost lever observable in cost.json.",
