    {
      "id": "claim_57ee59f24cae47d28f136d66acf1f280",
      "statement": "Cross-section aggregation takes the median of contributing scores rather than the mean, chosen for robustness so a single section that misjudges a criterion cannot drag the document's verdict, with an even-count median rounded to the nearest integer.",
