      "id": "claim_b97fa73a9b4c4d818ee9908c8bc61f88",
      "statement": "The retained justification and evidence come from the contributing section whose score is closest to the median with ties resolved to the earliest section, keeping the reported rationale attached to a real section's reasoning rather than synthesized, and making the choice deterministic.",
